findings.comment:
750.800b - The following food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) fry baskets (grease/buildup - time for detail cleaning);
B) fan in kitchen on ledge facing prep area (dust);
C) inside ice machines (mold - around cube compartments).

Clean and sanitize food contact surfaces between uses/as needed to prevent cross contamination and eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled with grease, dust, and/or general debris:
A) sides of fryer;
B) range-top oven - 1. bottom inside oven, 2. rack inside oven, & 3. drip tray below stove;
C) inside pizza ovens; and
D) round fan below microwaves in store.
Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
